        "kcal": 800,
        "line": "🍽️ You push half your bowl across the fire to Grace — 'eat. You need it more than I do.' Grace doesn't argue. The bowl comes back scraped clean."
      },
      {
        "day": 132,
        "vid": "gen_74dwcf0",
        "kcal": 1500,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Kulpash looks it. You set your second half in front of Kulpash. 'Eat,' you say. Kulpash eats like someone making up for days."
      },
      {
        "day": 134,
        "vid": "stan_kowalski",
        "kcal": 500,
        "line": "🍽️ You wave off the second scoop and nod toward Stan. 'Stan eats first tonight.' Nobody at the fire disagrees."
      },
      {
        "day": 143,
        "vid": "stan_kowalski",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ Half your share tonight. You hand the rest to Stan, who takes it with both hands and doesn't say a word until it's gone."
      },
      {
